## 🎯 Overview

Recipe Finder is a full-stack recipe management application that allows users to register, login, create, edit, delete, and favorite recipes. Users can search across all public recipes or discover new recipes from external sources like TheMealDB.

**Version 2.0** introduces enterprise-grade DevOps practices including automated testing, continuous integration/deployment, containerization, and real-time monitoring.

