## 🛠️ Tech Stack

### Backend
- **FastAPI** - Modern, fast Python web framework
- **SQLAlchemy** - SQL toolkit and ORM
- **Pydantic** - Data validation using Python type hints
- **Argon2-CFFI** - Secure password hashing (upgraded from bcrypt)
- **Python-JOSE** - JWT token handling
- **httpx** - Async HTTP client for external APIs
- **Uvicorn** - ASGI server

### Frontend
- **HTML5/CSS3** - Semantic markup and modern styling
- **Vanilla JavaScript** - No frameworks, pure JS
- **Font Awesome** - Icon library
- **Responsive Design** - Mobile-first approach

### Database
- **SQLite** - Development database (lightweight)
- **PostgreSQL** - Production-ready option

### DevOps & Infrastructure
- **Docker** - Containerization platform
- **Docker Compose** - Multi-container orchestration
- **GitHub Actions** - CI/CD automation
- **Prometheus** - Metrics collection and monitoring
- **Grafana** - Metrics visualization and dashboards

### Testing
- **Pytest** - Testing framework
- **Coverage.py** - Code coverage measurement
- **TestClient** - FastAPI testing utilities
- **SQLite Memory DB** - In-memory test database

