## 🐳 Docker Deployment

### Single Container Deployment

```bash
# Build Docker image
docker build -t recipe-app:latest .

# Run container
docker run -d \
  -p 8000:8000 \
  --name recipe-container \
  recipe-app:latest

# View logs
docker logs -f recipe-container

# Stop and remove
docker stop recipe-container
docker rm recipe-container
```

### Multi-Container with Monitoring (Recommended)

```bash
# Start all services (App + Prometheus + Grafana)
docker-compose up -d

# Check status
docker-compose ps

# View logs
docker-compose logs -f

# View specific service logs
docker-compose logs -f app

# Stop all services
docker-compose down
```

**Services Available:**

| Service | URL | Credentials |
|---------|-----|-------------|
| Recipe App | http://localhost:8000 | - |
| API Docs | http://localhost:8000/docs | - |
| Prometheus | http://localhost:9090 | - |
| Grafana | http://localhost:3000 | admin/admin |

### Docker Image Details

- **Base Image**: `python:3.10-slim`
- **Image Size**: ~198 MB (optimized)
- **Build Type**: Multi-stage build
- **Health Check**: Automatic with `/health` endpoint

